{
  "id": "ch01_s10_yeting",
  "chapter": 1,
  "act": 1,
  "scene": "yeting",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "songhuizhen",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "两个经办女人自行安排病舍核领，不等主角来解题",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "同一上午，病舍的布包还在掖庭等着交。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l2",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_issue_now": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "一束新领的线压着余数簿，窗外传来剪刀开合的声响。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l3",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_issue_now": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "布先领了，今日还能裁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_issue_now": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_issue_now": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "补这一束线，我又从东头跑来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_issue_now": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "余数没抹，下回约在一处交，省得各跑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_issue_now": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一处交。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_issue_now": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这次我来了，下次可不能再靠顺路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_wait_full": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "昨夜的灯盏还没洗，案角结着一小片黑灯花。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_wait_full": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "整份齐了，昨日的亮光也等没了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_wait_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_wait_full": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日还得赶回那半日裁工。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_wait_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "新才人抄完才走，我核到了末行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_wait_full": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "末行……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_wait_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "明夜不能这样熬了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.supply_wait_full": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "灯下留了两处位子，夜核的人也得轮。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l17",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "病舍那份，我送。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l18",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "送得去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l19",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那我就——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l20",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "谁见证她领了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l21",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "又来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l22",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我还不够？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l23",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你送、你核，还替她答，出了错全找你一个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l24",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l25",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "宋蕙贞解开冷潮的包布，折过的地方露出一道白痕。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l26",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那你跟我去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l27",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日可以，明日我在库里走不开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l28",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "明日……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l29",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我得陪人看病，等不到你收案。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l30",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "门外煎药的苦气钻过帘子，两人望着布包，谁也没再开口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l31",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日我去，明日换核簿的当值人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l32",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "当值人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l33",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "病舍这边也轮一个，别总是我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l34",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "名字写在门内，换值先交代未领的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l35",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不会写的，当面说呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l36",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l37",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "说完让她复一遍，我记。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l38",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "宋蕙贞拎起布包，唐简把笔插回笔袋，也站起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l39",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "走慢些，我这边重。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l40",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "重？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s10_yeting.l41",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "递过来一半。"
    }
  ],
  "goto": "ch01_s11_shishe"
}
